encoding  utf-8
survey GoughsOld

input NurseryEntrance/NurseryEntrance.th
input Concert/Concert.th
input Entrance/Entrance.th

equate 9@NurseryEntrance 10@Concert
equate 24@Entrance 10@Concert

map GoughsOldM
  ConcertM@Concert
  EntranceM@Entrance
  NurseryEntranceM@NurseryEntrance
endmap

map GoughsOldME90
  ConcertME90@Concert
  EntranceME90@Entrance
  NurseryEntranceME90@NurseryEntrance
endmap




endsurvey

